What are the benefits?
•	Better control of temperature, humidity and light
•	Protection from heavy rain, pests and strong sun
•	Efficient irrigation and fertigation
•	Easier crop monitoring
•	Production of high-value crops, including off-season
What can be grown in a polyhouse?
Depending on local conditions and the structure, farmers may grow:
•	Tomato
•	Capsicum
•	Cucumber
•	Flowers
•	Strawberry
•	Nursery plants
•	Selected vegetables
